## Saksha Merge Safety Rules

This repository is being developed in parallel by multiple contributors.

To minimize merge conflicts:

- Prefer creating new files over heavily modifying existing ones.
- Keep changes localized to the feature/module of this issue.
- Avoid unnecessary edits to shared files.
- Do not move or rename files.
- Preserve public APIs unless this issue explicitly requires changes.
- If another module needs changes, expose a small extension point instead of rewriting it.
- Make the smallest possible change that satisfies the issue.